        "createdRevision": 1190,
        "description": "Review the TypeScript autocomplete and expression-editing implementation against [the portable behavior reference](C:/Users/vince/Documents/GitHub/Btr/QueryComposerContext/README.md).\n\n1. Open a real TypeScript file in Repositories. The view toolbar offers Text mode and Expression mode as two IconRadioButton choices; switching preserves the document.\n2. In Expression mode, select a token to replace it or a gap to insert. Try project-aware member completion, entered text, Copy full input, Paste and Remove. Escape cancels pending input.\n3. Use Insert expression before/after and Remove expression in the supplied suggestion area. Check wrapping, continued editing and undo/redo across both modes.\n4. Expand an expression to inspect nested operation numbers and result references. This is a static evaluation outline, not a running debugger. Optional chains and reference-sensitive operations remain whole rather than show misleading steps.\n5. In Text mode, normal editing and coloring remain available; Ctrl+Space requests completion. Unsupported files retain ordinary Text mode.\n\nThe completion panel was also exercised with an unrelated suggestion layout to demonstrate reuse without a language dependency. LspContributor coordinates language capabilities; TypeScriptContributor supplies language semantics; RelationalUi owns presentation and editing. No external dependency was added. JSON autocomplete and runtime/debugging capabilities are outside this review.\n\nImplementation screenshots and verification evidence are attached to the covered task. Human acceptance is pending; subsequent execution-system work remains gated on this review.\n\nVerification: affected browser checks and type checks pass. The broad checkpoint is not fully green: isolated planning-timing, planning-UI and preview reruns passed, while the separate unchanged recovery editor still fails a CRLF/LF comparison. See the attached verification.md on the covered task for exact counts, corrections and remaining limits. Review branch: codex/typescript-autocomplete, latest commit 13ace5b.",
        "title": "Human review: accept autocomplete and token editing in real TypeScript files",
        "updatedAt": "2026-10-29T01:43:45.064Z",
        "updatedBy": "agent:codex"
      },
      "typeId": "planning:identity"
    },
